**How to make the actual request**

If you’re using the VirusTotal API v3, the endpoint would typically look something like:

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/graphs/search?q=145.34.45.56&limit=8&cursor=cursor_b
Authorization: Bearer api_key_2
```

Replace `api_key_2` with your actual API key. The response will contain the `id`s of the graphs that match the search criteria.
